# the SET page (after USB & MIDI on the dial): Rounds, Ramp, Intro; the intro's countdown in the header once playing
seed 0
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 900
release HOME
wait 100
expect fxpage 18
turn SELECT 2
wait 100
expect fxpage 25
shot set_page.png
spin K3 1
spin K1 2
spin K2 2
wait 300
shot set_page_on.png
tap HOME
wait 300
expect playing 1
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 0
tap PLAY
wait 300
expect playing 1
wait 4000
expect playing 1
shot intro_header.png
tap HOME
wait 500
shot intro_home.png
press GLO
wait 300
shot intro_mix.png
release GLO
wait 200
